id=dash_art_tune
name=Dash ART + BBRv3 + ADIOS + WLAN Log Tune
version=v1.4
versionCode=5
author=NuoFang6
description=Default BBRv3 + fq_codel, ADIOS, ART/CPU/dex2oat tuning, zram lz4kd restore, and vendor WLAN logging off: persist wlan_logs/cnss_diag/tcpdump switches, cnss_diag.conf LOG_PATH_FLAG=0 via bind mount, and wlan_logs cleanup with tcpdump.pcap0 as a directory.
